From fbf625760b3e7e84a9b4544db5700e2424e69b1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juansolo457 <5344231+Juansolo457@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:04:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: 360 controller rows in Game Options > Controller

360 Controller Feel (in_joystickXenon), Aim Assist (pm_AimAssist 0/2), Aim Assist
Friction (pm_AimAssistSlow), 360 Horizontal/Vertical/Zoomed Speed (in_xenon*), after
Controller Input. Rows below move 144 px; content height, section jumps, scroll range
and section thresholds follow, as do the settings registry and coverage test. Also
aligns the Weapon Kick hover, which sat 22 px above its row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
